sequenceDiagram
 actor User
 participant Frontend
 participant API as Backend/API
 participant Auth as Auth/ACL
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 participant Files as Private local storage
 User->>Frontend: Скачать конкретную версию
 Frontend->>API: GET /api/v1/documents/{doc_id}/versions/{version_id}/download
 API->>Auth: Current user ACTIVE, file action pinned version
 Auth->>DB: Session, owner / manager / current assignment / scoped grant
 Note over Auth,DB: RESTRICTED grants: expiry, scope, два текущих независимых offices
 alt Нет основания доступа
  API-->>Frontend: 401 либо 404 not_found
 else Доступ разрешён
  API->>DB: Version belongs to doc, production FileScan attestation
  API->>Files: Open key, read size/SHA, rewind
  alt Missing/corrupt file / no attestation
   API-->>Frontend: 503 file_unavailable / file_scan_required
  else Файл проверен
   API->>DB: Audit FILE_DOWNLOADED, COMMIT
   API-->>Frontend: 200 binary attachment stream
  end
 end
 Note over API,Files: Нет static/public URL, ClamAV при download заново не вызывается
